xt","block_id":"ota"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e898e86b-1d5b-4528-89dd-101d7eb621bf","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"ASUSあたりが信頼性最高なbLuetoothアダプタ作ってくれないものか。","ts":"1625184824.097100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HZ9q"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61d30b7f-05b5-42e1-8c65-064bb79c1cc2","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"ハマるとインストールでめっちゃ沼る（ ；´。 ｀；）","ts":"1625184750.096500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MlF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6cf437af-26da-4a58-92ac-b0f6eb140d27","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いやまあBTは周波数をどんどん変える動きだから説明が微妙に変だけど","ts":"1625184739.096100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KpOsV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"01d38677-8a86-4cd4-a9d4-31d8b5c5a3b5","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"というより、Bluetoothアダプタの信頼性が低い、かな。","ts":"1625184738.096000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IcC7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c1762026-02a4-4d4f-a3af-65d33619ad06","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あー、混雑範囲内だとノイズとWi-Fiからの回避でジャンプしすぎるんかな?","ts":"1625184717.095000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DqtC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"461599b0-326a-442b-8704-0bc21730f5e0","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"BT4だとちょっと混んでる電車で死ぬのはありますね\nBT5はまだ経験してない","ts":"1625184674.093800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GPO6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9a64e15f-e717-42c3-80bf-bbf50b798356","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"んー、そんなに問題になる?\n普通に使う範囲でBTでコケないけどなあ","ts":"1625184645.092900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ETmrq"}]},{"client_msg_i